{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Velora Player 是一款結合音樂播放與高清影片播放的 iOS 媒體工具，適合在 iPhone 或 iPad 上離線播放 MP3、FLAC、Full HD 與 4K 影片，並提供整齊的媒體庫管理。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>主要功能</h2>\n<p>音訊方面支援 MP3、FLAC、WAV、AAC、OGG、ALAC、AIFF、M4A 等格式，並提供均衡器、低音增強、Virtualizer、播放速度控制、睡眠計時器與無間斷播放。影片方面支援 MP4、MKV、AVI、MOV、WEBM、HEVC 等多種格式，同時具備畫中畫、浮動播放器、字幕支援、手勢控制及硬件加速，讓用家離線播放媒體時更流暢。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1025-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1026-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1027-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1028-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1029-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1030-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Velora Player: Video &amp; Audio</li>\n<li>應用類別：Entertainment</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-21T20:18:59.837353+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":366,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}